<title>NORTH KOREA: N.Korea wins $282 million in investment deals.</title>
<headline>N.Korea wins $282 million in investment deals.</headline>
<dateline>RAJIN, North Korea 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>North Korea signed $282 million worth of contracts with foreign investors at a three day forum on investment in the Rajin-Sonbong free-trade zone, a North Korean official said on Sunday.</p>
</text>
